  "title": "UK Faces Record Heatwave Deaths as Rising Temperatures Put Public Health Under Pressure",
  "summary": "The United Kingdom is facing a worrying public health challenge as new estimates suggest that heatwaves in 2026 could lead to the highest number of heat-related deaths since official monitoring began. Rising temperatures, longer periods of extreme heat, and changing weather patterns are increasing concerns among health experts, who warn that vulnerable groups are facing growing risks. According to figures released by the UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA), an estimated 2,877 deaths have already",
